      "internal": false,
      "mergeID": "660cb22135d4a19cc3d537de",
      "mergedPostDetails": "Currently there does not seem to be any entry in the Group's Audit Log when a group member with instance moderation uses their power to kick someone from an instance. This means that the group owner/management can't correctly determine if a group member is abusing their moderation powers.\n\nSimple request: If a group member with instance moderation powers kick a user from any Group (GP, G+, G) instance, add a log entry to the Group's Audit Log with the name of the kicker and kickee.\n\nI doubt it is necessary to log the use of the Warn or Force Mic Off moderation powers.",
      "mergedPostTitle": "Audit Log Entry when Kicking with Group Moderation",
      "pinned": false,
      "postID": "64b4be63cd8b940949602595",
      "private": false,
      "spam": false,
      "synthetic": true,
      "value": ""
    },
    {
